      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dignity is not found in the crown or the battle, but in how you choose to meet the end. If the external symbols of your life are gone, then the only thing left to claim is your own agency. You can choose the manner of your exit, transforming this ruin into a final statement of defiance. Let the final act be one of perfect, unyielding control over your own fate.",
